<title>USA: TABLE - CIT Group Hldgs sells notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CIT Group Hldgs sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from CIT Group Holdings was priced Wednesday according lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>CIT Group is a consumer finance company 80 percent owned by Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd and 20 percent owned by Chase Manhattan Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER CIT GROUP HOLDINGS</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN     COUPON 6.375 PCT	MATURITY 8/1/2002</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	 ISS PRICE 99.704	FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3 YIELD 6.445 PCT	 PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS  SPREAD 39 BP/WI 5 YR  CALLABLE  NO ((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
